      "bytes": 3131,
      "overall_design": "We have analyzed 5 spatial transcriptomic tissue sections from simple stage-3 clear cell Renal Cell Carcinoma tumors. FFPE tumor sections were placed on Visium gene expression slide and stained for morphological context using H&E. Spatial transcriptomics was performed by 10x Genomics Visium Certified Service Providers. ccRCC tissues were obtained from UC Tumor Bank. The results were processed by spaceRanger software to acquire expression matrix of each sample.\nSpatial transcriptomics images and expression files."
